{
  "name": "Discord Mass Role Assignment",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000001",
      "name": "▶ Run Manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 10 }]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000002",
      "name": "⏰ Schedule (every 10 min)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID", "mode": "id" },
        "sheetName":  { "__rl": true, "value": "Config", "mode": "name" },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000003",
      "name": "📋 Read Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [460, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": { "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Google Sheets account" }
      },
      "notes": "Config sheet must have a SINGLE ROW with two columns: guild_id and role_id.\nOne row = one item = Get Pending Users runs exactly once."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID", "mode": "id" },
        "sheetName":  { "__rl": true, "value": "Users", "mode": "name" },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [{ "lookupColumn": "status", "lookupValue": "" }]
        },
        "options": { "returnRowNumbers": true }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000004",
      "name": "👥 Get Pending Users",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [680, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": { "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Google Sheets account" }
      },
      "notes": "Reads only rows where status is blank. returnRowNumbers adds a row_number field to each item so the Update node knows exactly which row to write back to."
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "batchSize": 1, "options": {} },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000005",
      "name": "🔁 Loop (1 user at a time)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [900, 400],
      "notes": "'done' output (index 0) → leave UNCONNECTED.\n'loop' output (index 1) → Add Discord Role.\nThe loop runs because Update Row Status connects back to this node's INPUT."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "member",
        "operation": "roleAdd",
        "guildId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('📋 Read Config').first().json.guild_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "userId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.user_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "roleId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('📋 Read Config').first().json.role_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000006",
      "name": "🎭 Add Discord Role",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 400],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "credentials": {
        "discordBotApi": { "id": "YOUR_DISCORD_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Discord Bot account" }
      },
      "notes": "Adds the role to the user. continueOnFail means a failed call (404, 403 etc.) doesn't kill the loop — it passes an error item to the Update node so the row is stamped 'failed' instead."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID", "mode": "id" },
        "sheetName":  { "__rl": true, "value": "Users", "mode": "name" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('🔁 Loop (1 user at a time)').first().json.row_number }}",
            "status":     "={{ $json.error ? 'failed' : 'done' }}",
            "timestamp":  "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "error":      "={{ $json.error ? $json.error.toString().substring(0, 200) : '' }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": ["row_number"],
          "schema": [
            { "id": "row_number", "displayName": "row_number", "required": false, "defaultMatch": true,  "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true  },
            { "id": "status",     "displayName": "status",     "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": false },
            { "id": "timestamp",  "displayName": "timestamp",  "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": false },
            { "id": "error",      "displayName": "error",      "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": false }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000007",
      "name": "✅ Update Row Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1340, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": { "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Google Sheets account" }
      },
      "notes": "row_number comes from the loop item (reliable with batchSize=1).\nstatus is 'done' if no error, 'failed' if the Discord node errored.\nAfter writing, the connection back to the Loop input triggers the next iteration."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Discord Mass Role Assignment\n\n### Flow\n```\n[Trigger]\n  → Read Config        (1 row → 1 item)\n  → Get Pending Users  (filters blank status)\n  → Loop               ('loop' output only)\n  → Add Discord Role   (native Discord node)\n  → Update Row Status  (writes done/failed)\n  → back to Loop\n```\n**Loop 'done' output → leave unconnected.**\n\n---\n\n### Google Sheets setup\n\n**Tab: Config — one header row + one data row**\n| guild_id           | role_id            |\n|--------------------|--------------------|\n| 123456789012345678 | 987654321098765432 |\n\n⚠️ Must be a single data row with columns named exactly `guild_id` and `role_id`.\n\n**Tab: Users**\n| user_id            | status | timestamp | error |\n|--------------------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| 111222333444555666 |        |           |       |\n\nLeave status **blank** for pending rows.\n\n---\n\n### Setup checklist\n- [ ] Replace `YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID` on Read Config, Get Pending Users, Update Row Status\n- [ ] Set Google Sheets credential on those same three nodes\n- [ ] Set Discord Bot credential on Add Discord Role\n- [ ] Bot has `MANAGE_ROLES` and sits above the target role in hierarchy\n\n---\n\n### Status values\n| `done`   | Role assigned ✅             |\n| `failed` | Error — see error column     |",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000008",
      "name": "📖 Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, -360]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "▶ Run Manually": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "📋 Read Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "⏰ Schedule (every 10 min)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "📋 Read Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "📋 Read Config": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "👥 Get Pending Users", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "👥 Get Pending Users": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "🔁 Loop (1 user at a time)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "🔁 Loop (1 user at a time)": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [{ "node": "🎭 Add Discord Role", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "🎭 Add Discord Role": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "✅ Update Row Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "✅ Update Row Status": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "🔁 Loop (1 user at a time)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner"
  },
  "meta": { "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false }
}
